## 2. OUTDOOR PHOTOGRAPHY

- **Portrait & Event**: Focuses on human subjects. Styles include weddings, fashion, street candid photography, and sports.
- **Nature & Travel**: Captures the outdoors. Sub-genres include wildlife, astrophotography, macro (extreme close-ups of small subjects), and aerial/drone shots.
- **Commercial & Object**: Designed to market items or places. This covers architectural, real estate, food, and still-life photography.

